All tests in this directory should be compared against a known good terminal.
Personally, I compare to foot, but alacritty is known to be good too. The tests
can be run by 'cat'ing them to the terminal, or replayed slowly with the runner
helper:

	cat testdata/vim_simple_edit
	go run testdata/runner.go testdata/vim_simple_edit

The directory is named testdata so the go tool ignores it and the recordings
stay out of the build.

These tests are pulled from:
https://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/tree/master/alacritty_terminal/tests/ref
